'''Little Horn''' is a [[boss]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'' that can appear in all environments of [[Chapter 1]] ({{s|Basement}}, {{s|Cellar}}, {{s|Burning Basement}}).

== Behavior ==
Little Horn constantly tries to evade Isaac by moving away from him while performing the following attacks:
* Creates and jumps into a {{e|Pitfall}} and pops up elsewhere.
* Creates 3 to 5 {{e|Teleport Pitfall|text=Teleport Pitfalls}} that move outwards.
* Creates a regular Pitfall under himself that lasts for several seconds.
* Throws a {{e|Troll Bomb}} or a {{e|Mega Troll Bomb}} into a created Pitfall underneath himself. The bomb then pops up near Isaac's position.
* Jumps into a Pitfall and appears elsewhere while leaving a Troll Bomb in his place; repeats this process 3-5 times.
* Spawns a {{e|Dark Ball}}.
{{dlc|r}} Little Horn takes reduced damage (25 instead of 100) from his own bombs. Bombs from other sources still do full damage.

== Champion Versions {{unlockable}} ==
: {{bc|18|dlc=a+}}: Does not attack with Pits, Troll Bombs, or Mega Troll Bombs, but fires Dark Balls more frequently. This version can still do the chain teleport attack, but doesn't spawn any Troll Bombs.
: {{bc|6|dlc=a+}}: Spits out an orange Troll Bomb instead of a Dark Ball. This Troll Bomb deals contact damage and leaves a patch of fire similar to {{I|Hot Bombs}} that cannot damage him. He also throws these special Troll Bombs into burning Pitfalls instead of normal ones, and spawns them during the chain teleport attack. He loses 1 HP whenever he spits out a bomb. Does not attack with Mega Troll Bombs.

